        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFeel at home in this well-connected North Dublin coastal suburbs\n\nSet in the bustling seaside village of Portmarnock these apartments benefit from superb transport links and a thriving local community. The Brickworks, Station Manor offers a selection of brand new 2-bedroom apartments available for their first letting.\n\nSeaside and village convenience on your doorstep \n\nThe Brickworks, Station Manor is located in the picturesque village of Portmarnock. You have all the convenience of great transport links to the city center and beyond, easy access to the M50 and Dublin Airport. Portmarnock Village is a short stroll away which provides for your every need with an excellent choice of retail and services. Numerous grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants can all be enjoyed in this desireable neighborhood. The Stunning beaches in Portmarnock open up a wide variety of leisure activities and the famous silver strand beach offers views of Ireland's Eye, Howth Head, and Lambay Island. \n\nThe Brickworks, Station Manor is a new development of apartments located in the seaside village of Portmarnock which are available for their first letting. The scheme is conveniently located on Station Road with Portmarnock Train Station on its door step making The Brickworks, Station Manor a superb transport hub for an easy commute to the city center. Portmarnock Village is a short stroll away and provides an array of retail and leisure outlets and amenities.\n\nOnly a short distance away are the neighboring villages of Malahide and Howth with an abundance of additional amenities and services. \n\nThe Brickworks, Station Manor apartments are designed and built to the highest standards . All apartments are larger than standard giving you even more flexibility on how you use and share the space and many of the upper floor units have stunning views.\n\nApartment Perks: \n-A rated BERs\n-Complimentary Wifi (speeds up to 100MB/s)\n-Complimentary TV Package (50+ Channels)\n- Balcony \n- Ensuite bathroom \n- Integrated Kitchen \n- Fully Furnished \n- Smart Energy Meter \n- Modern Appliances\n - Modern Furnishings\n- 24/7 Assistance\n\n Building Perks \n- Pet Friendly Building (T & C's Apply) \n- Landscaped Gardens \n- Dedicated Resident App\n- Bicycle storage \n- Car Park \n- Recycling \n- Secure Access Control \n- Environmental Waste Disposal \n\nThe dedicated team at havitat are on hand to assist in any management or maintenance queries to ensure everything runs smoothly in your new home at The Brickworks, Station Manor by havitat. This is aided by the 24 hour-accessible resident's online app. \n\n*Rent inclusive of Parking Charge\n\n* Please vist www.havitat.ie for more information * \n\n** Please note photos may not be specific to this apartment but all apartments are finished to similar standard. \n\n*** Please note apartment size is based on the average size, the size of actual apartments may differ\n\n**** Please note there are multiple property types available in this development.\nThe rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types.\nRents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents listed here; please use those available at viewings"
